5. Post-Build Actions — Archive Artifacts

	Use your application-build-demo project.

Go to:

	Configure → Post-build Actions → Archive the artifacts

Enter:

	build/**

	Save and build again.

After the build:

	Build # → Artifacts

You should see:

	build-info.txt
	Understand the difference
	Workspace
	    ↓
	Build creates files
	    ↓
	Post-build action
	    ↓
	Archive artifact

	Workspace: working area used during the build.

	Artifact: output that Jenkins preserves after the build.


