9. Mini Project — Git → Build → Artifact

Now combine everything.

Create:

	python-ci-freestyle

Step 1 — Git

Configure:

	Source Code Management
	        ↓
	Git
	        ↓
	Repository URL
	        ↓
	*/main


Step 2 — Build Step

	#!/bin/bash

	set -e

	echo "===== Python CI Build ====="

	python3 --version

	echo "Installing dependencies..."

	python3 -m venv env

	source env/bin/activate

	if [ -f requirements.txt ]; then
	    pip3 install -r requirements.txt
	fi

	echo "Running tests..."

	if command -v pytest >/dev/null 2>&1; then
	    echo "pytest is installed"
	else
	    echo "pytest not installed"
	fi

	echo "Creating build directory..."

	mkdir -p build

	echo "Application: Python Application" > build/build-info.txt
	echo "Build: $BUILD_NUMBER" >> build/build-info.txt
	echo "Date: $(date)" >> build/build-info.txt

	cat build/build-info.txt

	echo "Build successful!"


Step 3 — Archive Artifact

Go to:


	Post-build Actions → Archive the artifacts

Enter:

	build/**
	Final flow
	GitHub
	   ↓
	Jenkins Freestyle Job
	   ↓
	Git Checkout
	   ↓
	Install Dependencies
	   ↓
	Run Tests
	   ↓
	Build
	   ↓
	Create Artifact
	   ↓
	Archive Artifact


10. Mini Project — Parameterized Environment Build

Create:

	environment-build-demo

Parameters:

	ENVIRONMENT
	VERSION

Example:

	ENVIRONMENT = dev
	VERSION     = 1.0.0

Build step:

	#!/bin/bash

	echo "================================"
	echo "        Application Build"
	echo "================================"

	echo "Environment : $ENVIRONMENT"
	echo "Version     : $VERSION"
	echo "Build       : $BUILD_NUMBER"

	mkdir -p build

	cat > build/deployment-info.txt <<EOF
	Application: myapp
	Environment: $ENVIRONMENT
	Version: $VERSION
	Build: $BUILD_NUMBER
	Date: $(date)
	EOF

	cat build/deployment-info.txt

	Archive:

	build/**

	Run it three times:

	dev  → 1.0.0
	qa   → 1.0.0
	prod → 1.0.0

	Compare the three builds.





